00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:34.240
Master Kaoru!

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:46.650
Nadeshiko!

00:18:47.190 --> 00:19:07.080
Master Kaoru?

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.810
I'm surprised to see you here.

00:19:11.250 --> 00:19:13.380
I was worried about you.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.780
So I went to Master Keita...

00:19:14.780 --> 00:19:17.190
Are you all right, Nadeshiko?

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:18.290
Yes.

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.220
Nadeshiko.

00:19:25.390 --> 00:19:27.060
Hey, long time no see.

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.500
To think we'd meet here.

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.770
Same here.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.270
Yoko? Nice to meet you.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:36.570
Yeah.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.680
Karina?

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:50.690
Don't just look. Help me.

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:53.690
All the actors are in place.

00:19:54.260 --> 00:19:56.090
The two Inukami Users,

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:59.930
Kaoru Kawahira's pet dog, and the golden Yoko.

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:02.630
Sekidousai.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:06.300
Kaoru Kawahira,
I shouldn't have underestimated you.

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.670
What's wrong with you anyway?

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:11.710
Making weird things, cooped up for centuries,

00:20:11.710 --> 00:20:14.910
and now you're playing with all of us.

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:17.650
Men, men, men, just men.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:20.950
Even hidden camera shows these days aren't this bad.

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:22.820
You're not making any sense.

00:20:22.820 --> 00:20:24.490
You pass.

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.250
Congrats.

00:20:26.590 --> 00:20:28.420
Are you even listening?

00:20:28.420 --> 00:20:29.860
Yes.

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:34.300
I was testing your spiritual power and willpower.

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:39.530
Ever since I lost my power, I've been waiting for the day of my revival.

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:43.840
And then you guys came.

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:46.570
Inukami Users and their pet dogs.

00:20:46.570 --> 00:20:50.450
You shall be the energy for my revival.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:52.180
Revival?

00:20:52.180 --> 00:20:55.650
When I return to Earth,
I will remake the world.

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:58.690
It'll be a world where everyone can fulfill their desires.

00:20:59.090 --> 00:21:00.590
And that is...

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:05.230
the world without restraint that I want!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:13.170
He's a pervert!

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:16.040
Marro, what do you like?

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.770
Marro, what do you dislike?

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:25.010
I still can't go to where Master Keita is.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:43.100
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.100 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.610
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:59.010
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.350 --> 00:22:01.880
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.520
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:07.260
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:10.660
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.560
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:16.360
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.360 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.010
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.010 --> 00:22:26.710
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.710 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.180 --> 00:22:35.580
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:41.920
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:54.040
Inukami!

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.970
See you!

00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:56.100
Next episode preview

00:22:56.100 --> 00:22:57.400
Mammoths.
Next episode preview

00:22:57.400 --> 00:23:00.610
They are giants from the elephant family.

00:23:00.940 --> 00:23:04.580
It's an elephant with a thick, long nose and sharp tusks.

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:08.850
In other words, it's a stronger and greater elephant.

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:11.950
Also, it's very hairy.

00:23:12.390 --> 00:23:14.960
Sometimes they get really excited.

00:23:15.360 --> 00:23:16.860
Next on Inukami.

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:18.660
"Mammoth Trouble!"

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:20.030
If you watch the next episode,

00:23:20.030 --> 00:23:21.530
Mammoth Trouble!

00:23:21.530 --> 00:23:24.330
I would also be very excited.

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:25.000
Mammoth Trouble!
